            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Desmoche is a Nicaraguan rummy game, also played as conquién in Nicaragua, where players try to lay exactly ten cards in sets or runs.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Desmoche probably arose in Nicaragua in the first half of the 20th century and is closely related to Conquian and Gin Rummy.',
              },
